# Runtime dependencies of the WearIt FastAPI backend.
# Source of truth for pip-tools. The compiled lock is requirements.txt.
#
# Regenerate:
#   pip-compile --output-file requirements.txt requirements.in
#
# Top-level packages are pinned to versions verified working with Python 3.11
# (the production image base). If you bump a version here, regenerate the lock
# and re-verify against python:3.11-slim.
#
# NOTE: google-genai and httpx are required at STARTUP even though Gemini is
# paused — api/profile.py imports gemini_service at module level, which imports
# `google.genai`, and profile.py itself imports httpx.
#
# requests + pillow are intentionally NOT here: they are only used by dev-only
# scripts (seed_dev_catalog.py, _verify_catalog.py) and are not needed by the
# production image.

